OL,3,GNEWSAWhat does it take to make a world 
OL,4,Achampion dumpling?                     
OL,6,FTo win the World Dumpling Championship 
OL,7,Fnot only takes a recipe that tastes    
OL,8,Fdelicious, but requires an extra       
OL,9,Fingredient of a brilliant story behind 
OL,10,Fit.                                    
OL,12,FFounded in 2019 by Eve Stebbing, the   
OL,13,Fannual championship takes place in     
OL,14,FNorwich with up to five entrants who   
OL,15,Feach bring their own recipe.           
OL,17,FThe city provides the venue because    
OL,18,FNorfolk gives its name to dumplings    
OL,19,Fthat "swim" on the surface of stews.   
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
