OL,3,GNEWSAWhat does it take to make a world 
OL,4,Achampion dumpling?                     
OL,6,F"The dumpling has always been famed    
OL,7,Fthroughout the land. We've been        
OL,8,Frenowned for them. I'm really glad we  
OL,9,Fhave managed to claim the World        
OL,10,FChampionship for the county, it's      
OL,11,Frichly deserved," said Stebbing.       
